eine Haftpflichtversicherung gefordert wurde und ein Nachweis mit einer zu niedrigen Deckungssume eingereicht wird, führt dies zwingend zum Ausschluss. Eine Nachforderung eines höheren Deckungsnachweises ist ausgeschlossen."},{"code":"nyk","field_id":"BT-79-Lot","list":"requirement-stage","ordinal":0,"type":"code"},{"code":"DEU","field_id":"BT-97-Lot","list":null,"ordinal":0,"type":"code"},{"field_id":"BT-98-Lot","ordinal":0,"type":"number","unit":"DAY","value":43.0},{"code":"performance","field_id":"OPT-060-Lot","list":"conditions","ordinal":0,"type":"code"},{"field_id":"OPT-301-Lot-AddInfo","is_ref":true,"ordinal":0,"scheme":null,"type":"id","value":"ORG-0002"},{"field_id":"OPT-301-Lot-ReviewOrg","is_ref":true,"ordinal":0,"scheme":"organization","type":"id","value":"ORG-0003"},{"field_id":"OPT-301-Lot-TenderReceipt","is_ref":true,"ordinal":0,"scheme":null,"type":"id","value":"ORG-0004"},{"field_id":"UBL-ElectronicOrderUsage","ordinal":0,"type":"integer","value":1},{"field_id":"UBL-ElectronicPaymentUsage","ordinal":0,"type":"integer","value":1}]},{"kind":"Change","parent_section_id":"PROCEDURE","section_id":"ND-Change#0","values":[{"field_id":"BT-141(a)-notice","lang":"DEU","ordinal":0,"type":"text","value":"Es gibt keine Änderungen. Nur das Dokument wurde hochgeladen. Alle beteiligte Bieter hatten den Vertrag vorab über Kommunikation erhalten."},{"field_id":"BT-718-notice","ordinal":0,"type":"integer","value":0}]},{"kind":"ChangedSection","parent_section_id":"ND-Change#0","section_id":"ND-ChangedSection#0","values":[{"field_id":"BT-13716-notice","is_ref":false,"ordinal":0,"scheme":null,"type":"id","value":"PROCEDURE"}]},{"kind":"ContractingParty","parent_section_id":"PROCEDURE","section_id":"ND-ContractingParty#0","values":[{"code":"education","field_id":"BT-10-Procedure-Buyer","list":"authority-activity","ordinal":0,"type":"code"},{"code":"body-pl-ra","field_id":"BT-11-Procedure-Buyer","list":"buyer-legal-type","ordinal":0,"type":"code"},{"field_id":"OPT-300-Proc